 come from{ klama} rather than something that does not involve purposeful a=
ctivity.  MB cites some other more plausible cases, but the whole is very n=
on-standard, since the usual procedure is just quantifying off.  Clearly ha=
ving {zi'o} as a value for {zo'e} would just make a bad situation even wors=
e, as would {zi'o} as a value for an unfilled space.

